  Q('base-2-c','常见的基础胡牌结构是什么？','What is the common basic winning shape?','a',[['a','四组面子加一对将','Four sets and a pair'],['b','五组面子','Five sets'],['c','七张牌组成一组','A seven-tile set']],'这是基础结构；实际能否胡还需看该玩法的特殊牌型与限制。','This is a basic shape. Special patterns and ruleset restrictions still matter.')
