  Q('base-3-c','四组一对已经拼好，就在任何玩法里自动可以胡吗？','Does four sets and a pair automatically win in every ruleset?','c',[['a','一定可以','Always'],['b','只看能不能碰','Only if you can pung'],['c','还要核对各玩法条件','Check the chosen ruleset']],'香港有番数门槛；四川要打完定缺；美式还需按年度牌型卡核对。','Hong Kong has a faan minimum, Sichuan requires a missing suit, and American hands follow a card.')
